                "Detects cardiac arrhythmias, ischaemia, or myocardial infarction. g) Chest X -ray.",
                "Assesses lung pathology such as pneumonia, pulmonary oedema, or pneumothorax.",
                "Detects respiratory failure, metabolic acidosis, or hypoxaemia.",
