                    "Consider non-invasive ventilation (e.g., CPAP, BiPAP) if the patient has respiratory failure.",
                    "Treat underlying causes, such as pneumonia, pulmonary embolism, or pneumothorax.",
                    "Insert IV access and administer IV fluids (e.g., 500 mL of normal saline over 15 minutes) for hypotension.",
