                "Due to ventricular fibrillation or severe myocardial infarction.",
                "Following a large myocardial infarction.",
                "It presents as stable angina, unstable angina, or myocardial infarction.",
                "Diagnosis involves ECG, troponin measurement, and coronary angiography."
