                "Airway management is the priority (intubation or tracheostomy), followed by IV antibiotics (ceftriaxone or cefotaxime).",
                "Dexamethasone may be used to reduce swelling.",
                "Includes continuous monitoring of respiratory status, ICU care following intubation, and adjustment of antibiotics based on culture results."
