                "To rule out systemic causes, such as infection or autoimmune disorders in chronic urticaria.",
                "In chronic cases, especially with angioedema, to check for autoimmune thyroid disease, which can be associated with chronic urticaria.",
                "C-reactive protein (CRP) or erythrocyte sedimentation rate (ESR).",
