                "Diagnose based on the appearance of the rash, type of lesion (maculopapular, urticarial, bullous), and distribution. \u2022 History of drug use.",
                "Elevated eosinophils suggest a drug hypersensitivity reaction. \u2022 Liver and renal function tests.",
