                "Most drug eruptions resolve within 1-2 weeks after stopping the causative medication. \u2022 In severe cases like SJS or DRESS, involvement of mucosal surfaces and systemic symptoms (fever, lymphadenopathy, organ involvement) is diagnostic. \u2022 The first and most important step is to stop the offending drug.",
