                "Includes thyroid-stimulating hormone (TSH), free thyroxine (T4), and free triiodothyronine (T3) to assess thyroid function.",
                "Most patients with thyroid cancer have normal thyroid function, but TFTs help rule out thyroid dysfunction.",
