                "Enhances vocal function, reduces strain, and improves communication.",
                "Injection of materials (e.g., hyaluronic acid, collagen, fat) into the paralyzed vocal cord to bulk it up and move it towards the midline.",
                "Improves glottic closure during phonation, enhancing voice quality and reducing aspiration risk.",
