                "Endoscopy reveals oesophageal rings, linear furrows, white plaques, or exudates.",
                "Biopsies from multiple areas of the oesophagus are required for histological confirmation, showing infiltration of eosinophils (\u226515 eosinophils per high -power field is diagnostic).",
