                "To assess liver damage, with elevated ALT and AST indicating hepatocellular injury.",
                "Elevated bilirubin and albumin levels may suggest advanced liver disease or cirrhosis.",
                "HFE gene mutation analysis is the definitive test for hereditary haemochromatosis.",
