                "Weakness or paralysis of the eye muscles, causing double vision or difficulty moving the eyes.",
                "Difficulty with balance and coordination, leading to unsteady walking.",
                "Disorientation, difficulty with concentration, and short-term memory loss.",
                "Apathy or mental sluggishness, which can progress to stupor or coma in severe cases.",
                "Hypothermia and hypotension, especially in advanced cases. 2207 Peripheral neuropathy."
