                "It is often associated with demyelinating diseases, particularly multiple sclerosis (MS), but can also occur in isolation or in association with infections, autoimmune diseases, or other neurological conditions.",
                "The inflammation disrupts the normal conduction of visual signals, leading to vision loss and other visual disturbances.",
