                "The sclera provides structural support to the eye and protects the internal components.",
                "Scleritis often occurs as a result of systemic autoimmune diseases such as rheumatoid arthritis or granulomatosis with polyangiitis (Wegener's granulomatosis), but can also be idiopathic.",
