                "Provides detailed images of the retina and vitreoretinal interface, useful in assessing underlying macular disease. e) Intraocular Pressure (IOP) Measurement.",
                "Elevated pressure may indicate neovascular glaucoma, especially in patients with diabetic retinopathy."
