                    "It is characterised by periods of flare-ups (active disease) and remission (inactive disease).",
                    "SLE predominantly affects women of childbearing age, especially those of African, Asian, or Hispanic descent, and is associated with the production of a wide range of autoantibodies, particularly anti-nuclear antibodies (ANA) and anti-double-stranded DNA (anti -dsDNA).",
