                "CT or MRI may be used to confirm the diagnosis and assess nerve involvement.",
                "Non-Surgical Treatment (the first-line approach for most cases).",
                "Patients are advised to avoid activities that exacerbate symptoms, such as repetitive extension movements or heavy lifting.",
                "Athletes may need to rest from sports that involve hyperextension of the spine until the pain resolves. 2639 Physical therapy.",
                "A physiotherapy program focuses on strengthening the core muscles (especially the abdominals and paraspinal muscles ) to provide better support to the spine and reduce stress on the pars interarticularis.",
